{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1349530-mage-the-awakening-demo","id":1349530,"title":"Mage: The Awakening Demo","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-11-19T01:37:06-08:00","id":1349530,"title":"Mage: The Awakening Demo","content":"After a lot of years I managed to convince my players to play Mage. The problem is that I'm quite rusty so I wanted to use the demo but I have a question:<br /> Is the plot heavily tailored around the pregen characters or are the players free to create their own pcs without tweaking anything?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13735-pr0m3th3us","name":"Pr0m3th3uS","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-19T02:51:17-08:00","id":1349534,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pr0m3th3uS</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1349530-mage-the-awakening-demo#post1349530\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">After a lot of years I managed to convince my players to play Mage. The problem is that I'm quite rusty so I wanted to use the demo but I have a question:<br /> Is the plot heavily tailored around the pregen characters or are the players free to create their own pcs without tweaking anything?</div> </div> </div> </div>Some of them are. For exmaple, Made Men is written assuming one of the characters has relatives in the Mafia.<br /> <br /> The Goetic spirits don't really work the way that they're presented... but you can just handwave that easily (Just say they're Abyssal or whatever). Importantly the demo assumes your players don't have Spirit 3 for most of the demo. (For 2e Mind 3 would have the same effect).<br /> <br /> Also, the plot key off the Vices of the PCs. So for example if none of your players have something like Lust as a Vice, then Siren's Song is not going to work.<br /> <br /> Actually what I'd suggest is that the Goetia are preset to the 7 sins and that they just latch onto the first mages they find.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}